        "TileImage": "$($repository a610f524-466d-4ac9-b3e8-861b37a9b848).Image",
        "Description": "Five years ago, a flawless bank heist turned into a bloodbath. The job was tight. The crew tighter. Until someone talked.\r\rThe East 40th Job was supposed to retire them all — clean getaway, no heat. But minutes before extraction, the NYPD hit the scene like they were reading the script. One crew member took the fall. The rest vanished with the money.\r\rToday, that crew walks the marble halls of Milton-Fitzpatrick, hiding behind new names and false jobs, convinced the past is buried. They’re wron",
